  "description": "This premium kids bike sets the new standard for growing riders. Koda Plus combines a lightweight aluminum frame, kid-centric ergonomic design, and a dual hand brake system with adjustable reach levers to provide unmatched comfort and top-tier safety. This kids bike is lightweight and easy to maneuver, giving your little one the confidence to ride and explore. The extra-low minimum seat height of 19\" and adjustable fit ensure the most comfortable ride that grows with them. Equipped with EasySafe front and rear V-brakes, fully aluminum levers, and tool-free reach adjustment, Koda Plus lets small hands grip and brake with ease, building confidence with every stop. With premium upgrades like internal cable routing and a threadless steering system, this sleek kids bike is designed like a grown-up bike and will inspire a lifetime of new adventures.",
